@host = http://localhost:5000
@token = pega-aqui-el-token

### Registrar estudiante con correo universitario
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "estudiante@cun.edu.co",
  "password": "Secreta1",
  "nombre": "Estudiante CUN",
  "telefono": "3001112233",
  "facultad": "Facultad de Ingeniería"
}

###

### Iniciar sesión y copiar el token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "estudiante@cun.edu.co",
  "password": "Secreta1"
}

###

### Espacios disponibles
GET {{host}}/api/spaces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Reservar la mesa de ping pong (ajusta spaceId según GET /api/spaces)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": 4,
  "fecha": "2026-10-08",
  "horaInicio": "10:00",
  "horaFin": "11:00"
}

###

### Mis reservas
GET {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Cancelar una reserva
DELETE {{host}}/api/reservations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
